WEBVTT

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.440
What?

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:54.040
You're all dolled up, Mikura.

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:56.890
You're so cute.

00:00:56.890 --> 00:00:58.950
Yeah, I'm going to meet someone.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.020
Then you're off on a date,
date, date, that is?

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.990
An old friend of mine. I ran into
her yesterday by coincidence.

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.960
She suggested we hang out since we
haven't done so in a while.

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.550
Anyway, I'm on my way!

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.130
She said it was a date.

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:12.620
For real?

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:29.280
Hey!

00:01:30.250 --> 00:01:31.950
It's you, Mikura!

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.520
Sakura Sakurada!

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.090
<i>Norikonda sabaibaru cousutaa</i>

00:01:42.090 --> 00:01:44.060
The survival roller coaster we got on

00:01:44.060 --> 00:01:46.830
There's no need to give up,
run by the highway

00:01:44.090 --> 00:01:46.530
<i>Akirame muyoude run by the highway</i>

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.400
<i>Kimiwa inochi karagara</i>

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:48.600
You just barely escaped with your life

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.930
<i>Atashitachimo nodoga karakara</i>

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:51.200
We're thirsty

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:53.130
<i>Kyokugento mugendai</i>

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.340
Extremities and infinity

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.470
<i>Tomo ni sorette mugendai</i>

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.700
Together, they form a fantasy

00:01:55.470 --> 00:01:57.370
<i>Kamaeta me hibana chiri</i>

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:57.570
The eyes, squaring away, are
throwing out sparks

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.400
<i>Oni-san kochira to shita o dasu</i>

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:00.630
"You're it! This way, " you say,
as you stick your tongue out

00:02:01.540 --> 00:02:02.630
<i>Wink</i>

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:02.700
Wink

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:06.310
<i>Kyouretsuna itamini kansha</i>

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.520
Grateful for the excruciating pain

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.650
<i>Power to iu na no rei de henkan</i>

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:08.950
I'm restored by a gratitude
known as power

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:14.560
<i>Mou sorosoro okaeri asobareta houga
iinodewa naide shouka</i>

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:14.760
Perhaps it would be better too return soon?

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:23.460
<i>Matsugeno sukima umeruyouni aimeiku</i>

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:23.700
As though filling in the gaps between
the eyelashes, eye make

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:30.770
<i>Kokorono sukima umeruyouni I take</i>

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:30.970
As though filling in the gaps of
my heart, I take

00:02:30.770 --> 00:02:35.240
<i>Gekiretsu panchide gyakuni takamaru</i>

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:35.440
On the contrary, the intensity is heightened
by a powerful punch

00:02:35.240 --> 00:02:39.710
<i>Yabai shiuchi hodo yokei moechauwa</i>

00:02:35.440 --> 00:02:39.780
The worse I'm treated, the more I get fired up

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:44.080
<i>Mouretsu panchide atashi takaburu</i>

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:44.220
I get worked up over an intense punch

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:52.510
<i>Sonna koto shite kurete arigatou</i>

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:53.060
Thank you for doing such a thing

00:02:53.130 --> 00:02:55.030
<i>Sukima sukima sukimani mimai</i>

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.230
A gap, a gap, pay a sympathy visit

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.030
<i>Janai janai itainjanai?</i>

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.200
Doesn't it, doesn't it, doesn't it hurt?

00:02:57.030 --> 00:02:58.700
<i>Mimai tsurai? ltai? Yabai?</i>

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:58.970
Is the visit painful? Does it hurt?
Is it dangerous?

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:03.330
<i>lkitai itai shitai, lkitai itai shitai</i>

00:02:58.970 --> 00:03:03.640
I want to go, I want to stay, I want to do it

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.650
How nostalgic.

00:03:09.650 --> 00:03:11.620
Have you been doing well?

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.180
Yeah, yeah!

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:14.060
What?

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:18.050
You've got a huge chest. You used to be flat.
Where'd you pick those up?

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:22.360
It's been three years, of course
they're going to get bigger.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.470
They seem soft. Let me touch them.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.960
Oh, stop it! Cut that out!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:33.700
<i>Shell of Lies</i>

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:31.910
What? What memories of the past
are you laughing at?

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:35.730
Jeez...

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:38.980
You pervert!

00:03:38.980 --> 00:03:40.470
Oh, good morning!

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:41.710
Good morning!

00:03:42.850 --> 00:03:45.340
I was so happy last night, I
couldn't go to sleep.

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.210
What a bunch of lies!

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.380
Hey!

00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:52.080
You two girls alone?

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:55.530
I have something great to talk about.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:57.860
If you're interested, how about we
go out for a cup of tea?

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:05.900
I'm serious, I was so excited.
I was really wide awake!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.440
Say, Sakurada.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:13.510
What have you been doing since then?

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.280
Well, all sorts of things.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.310
Say, say, it's been a while so why
don't we go there?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.530
Stray Cat!

00:04:23.530 --> 00:04:25.460
You got it, Mikura!

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:29.160
Well whenever we say, "there, " that's the only
place we could be talking about.

00:04:34.070 --> 00:04:39.200
A train with service beginning from this
station will be arriving at Platform One soon.

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:43.110
Please step behind the white line.

00:04:55.890 --> 00:04:57.860
Well... I'm in a bit of a hurry, so...

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.880
You... Pervert!

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:04.530
What?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.730
A pervert! Pervert!

00:05:05.730 --> 00:05:07.400
Really? Who?

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.600
Him!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.900
What a sickening head. He looks like Harada.

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.610
The doors will shut.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.180
Mikura!

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.640
Please be careful.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:41.770
Oh, this is delicious!

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:43.860
It's been three years since
we came here too.

00:05:44.340 --> 00:05:45.860
It's been that long.

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:48.910
Since we were separated...

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:02.790
Mikura, this is dangerous. Dangerous!

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:04.990
I won't screw up so badly that
I get caught by the cops.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:16.030
But they know what we look like.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:19.340
Being street kids, getting scared by
something like this

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:21.070
will only lead to not being able to eat dinner.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:28.510
You're right. I have to be strong.

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.050
This way's no good. Let's go that way!

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.260
I don't know how many ticks of this city
you sent to the hospital,

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:44.490
but if you injure a policeman, don't
you think you've gone too far?

00:06:44.770 --> 00:06:46.130
A cop?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.620
Indeed, I am.

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:49.090
Mikura...

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:54.370
A flip? What?

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:56.850
Run!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:06:58.350
But...

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:00.440
I'm all right! Hurry, hurry and run away!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:02.250
Hey, wait!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.190
Hey, hey, hey! I'm not laughing!

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.280
You're pulling my hair and it'll fall out!
Hey, hey, hair!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.350
Mikura!

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.560
We'll be able to meet again.

00:07:10.560 --> 00:07:15.290
Sakurada! Remember! A weakling won't
be able to eat dinner!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.800
It was cold, that time.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:24.940
The rain was cold.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.000
We haven't seen one another since then.

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:31.210
Mikura, I couldn't get a hold of you after that.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:33.540
Well, a lot of things happened.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.290
An overwhelming victory for
the Kuriyama Marrons!

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:41.020
They did not allow a run to the powerful
team, the Hachinosu Honeycombs!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:45.660
It seems unbelievable that they were
once the Peach Twisters.

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:48.490
The Peach Twisters no longer exist?

00:07:49.130 --> 00:07:50.900
The Momoi Investment Group went bankrupt

00:07:50.900 --> 00:07:53.890
and Kuriyama Electronics purchased it
along with the ball club.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:08.670
Is that so?

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.650
At one time, that's all there was in the news.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:15.750
Well, I don't have any interest
in things like that.

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:29.200
Oh, sorry. I'm going to make a phone call.

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:31.230
Could it be your boyfriend?

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.270
Hey! You traitor!

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:38.710
If I call him here, he'll know what I've been
up to due to the noise, won't he?

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.560
Hey! What gives?!

00:08:48.560 --> 00:08:49.760
I'm in a hurry!

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:51.530
You're the one who bumped into me!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:52.830
That's right!

00:08:52.830 --> 00:08:54.230
You two go to Hell!

00:08:59.900 --> 00:09:01.370
Hey! Be careful!

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:03.940
Hey! You're that pervert from this morning!

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:05.440
You're the clenched fist bitch!

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.040
Why are you even here?!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:10.010
I wasn't copping a feel! My hand just
bumped into you there!

00:09:10.480 --> 00:09:12.150
Oh, crap! Did I blow my cover?

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:13.370
At least apologize!

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:17.610
Why the hell do I need to apologize?

00:09:17.990 --> 00:09:19.150
What?

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:21.920
What the hell's with her? Oh, I can't
just stand around like this.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:26.390
Mikura?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.400
What?

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.100
What was that all about?

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:45.870
Mikura! Where were you?

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:50.740
The restroom. All of a sudden, I heard
some popping noises so I came back.

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.750
Let's get out of here!

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.220
Hey, hey, what the? Wait, wait, wait a minute!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:06.260
Maybe it was a mob dispute?

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:09.440
For real?

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:11.960
Some weird middle aged man was
indiscriminately shooting.

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:14.380
This place has gotten dangerous too.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:18.280
What are you talking about? You used to
go on rampages around here.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:20.180
Really? Then...

00:10:20.180 --> 00:10:21.720
You're guilty of the same crimes!

00:10:21.720 --> 00:10:22.740
Well, yeah.

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:31.420
After we separated,

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:34.220
I couldn't do anything on my own,

00:10:34.660 --> 00:10:36.990
so I was picked up, down and broken.

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.360
Picked up?

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:48.740
Just stay still.

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:50.370
Let's party!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.440
No!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.380
No!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:57.940
Hey, stupid.

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:15.260
Well, a lover and an attendant
to me, or something.

00:11:16.470 --> 00:11:21.240
That person was very scary when angry,
but was nice to me.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.570
I no longer had to live my life like a stray cat.

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.980
I see. Oh!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.680
What is it?

00:11:30.750 --> 00:11:32.650
It's the smell of broiled corn!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.820
It's been on my mind too. There!

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:38.230
It's certainly an effect of our favorite
food. Makes us an acute observer.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:39.890
<i>American Hot Dogs
250 yen each</i>

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:41.160
We used to want them so badly.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:41.160
<i>Corn on the Cob
200 yen each</i>

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:43.530
We stole them quite often.

00:11:44.130 --> 00:11:45.360
All right!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:47.070
Stop it, Mikura.

00:11:47.340 --> 00:11:49.130
Don't worry.

00:11:50.870 --> 00:11:52.110
I'll treat you!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:55.040
You're kidding me. I finally get to
see you spend money?

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:59.410
Hey! I wasn't that bad. Really!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:00.750
Oh, really?

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:14.820
Give me two.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:24.730
Hey, wait already!

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.680
Now, I can buy broiled corn with this!

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:41.580
Hey?

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:44.150
Ms. Mikura!

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:46.390
School backpack midget!

00:12:46.390 --> 00:12:48.120
What are you doing in a place like this?

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.360
Where are Mr. Harada and the others?

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:53.130
Harada? I'm not with him today.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.800
I see.

00:12:54.800 --> 00:12:57.030
What is it? Got some plans?

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.200
No.

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:01.500
Not really. Bye now.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.780
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:10.040
I dropped my money and it was
a close call. Here!

00:13:12.850 --> 00:13:15.120
Oh, I ate. I ate.

00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:17.930
By the way, what you said about
that person earlier,

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.920
the person who looked after you, you said?

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:23.760
They died.

00:13:24.530 --> 00:13:25.900
Why?

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.830
Murdered.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.600
I see.

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:34.070
You went through very trying times, Sakura.

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:37.380
These things...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.910
...are so unpleasant.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.420
I'm headed to the restroom.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:49.350
<i>Fountain Area
West Gate
Restroom</i>

00:13:45.190 --> 00:13:46.550
I didn't actually go the last time.

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:48.690
Me too.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:56.000
What's the matter, Harada?

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.060
This way!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.560
Creepy...

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:20.010
Today was a lot of fun.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:22.780
By the way,

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:26.390
as the last thing we do, there's a place I
want you to accompany me to.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:29.730
Sure. Anywhere!

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:38.700
An abandoned factory?

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.640
Why come here?

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.200
Why doesn't it go well?

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:46.770
What doesn't?

00:14:47.250 --> 00:14:48.370
Nothing.

00:14:52.390 --> 00:14:57.720
If it doesn't continue to flow,
then water will rot.

00:15:05.070 --> 00:15:07.970
So, why do you want to kill me?

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.170
So you know. Since when?

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:14.100
The moment I became sure of it
was that time...

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.450
What's this?

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.330
What was that all about?

00:15:45.770 --> 00:15:48.110
I have to hand it to you, Mikura.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:55.910
I wanted to know what happened to you and
what you've been up to all this time.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.120
After all, we haven't seen one another
for three years.

00:15:59.820 --> 00:16:03.620
But Sakura, you haven't asked
anything about me at all.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.290
You already knew about me when you
approached me, right?

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:11.890
You pretended everything was a coincidence.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:13.990
Isn't that right?

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:19.140
That's right. I know you very well.

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:23.870
Danger execution business, DSA's only
female member, Orange Woman!

00:16:34.390 --> 00:16:39.050
That is Momoi's daughter, the psycho
woman. How nostalgic.

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:44.420
That's right. The daughter of Momokichi
Momoi, the owner of the Peach Twisters,

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:46.560
Momomi Momoi.

00:16:46.870 --> 00:16:48.430
You killed her!

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:22.430
Why are you...

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:25.270
We were dating.

00:17:26.770 --> 00:17:28.070
But isn't that in bad taste?

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:33.480
The person who picked me up was
Momo-baby, Momomi Momoi.

00:17:37.650 --> 00:17:41.590
Momo-baby was who I idolized and
was everything to me.

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:45.410
At least since you disappeared
from my life, Mikura!

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.160
Sakura...

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:52.100
I was waiting for you all that time, but you
abandoned me and disappeared.

00:17:52.700 --> 00:17:56.260
I told you, a stray cat needs to
find its own food.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:59.460
Becoming discouraged will mean not living
long enough to eat dinner.

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:03.070
I wasn't any good unless I had you!

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:06.480
But by the time I had forgotten about you,

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.310
you all of a sudden took away
someone important to me.

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:15.220
I can't forgive you, Mikura!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:21.050
Wait! That was a job. That and she
was the one out to kill me.

00:18:21.330 --> 00:18:23.860
If I hadn't killed her, she would have
killed me, or so it goes.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:25.200
Shut up!

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:29.940
If you hadn't abandoned me...

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.000
If you hadn't taken Momomi away from me...

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:38.240
I don't care who it is. If you want a
piece of me, come on!

00:18:40.450 --> 00:18:44.120
Let's do it! I take after Momo-baby!

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:45.850
My killing techniques, anyway!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.180
Why you!

00:18:59.430 --> 00:19:00.560
Sakura?

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.670
This is nothing...

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:06.260
Don't pull it out!

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:08.540
You're worried about me?

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:10.110
Let's stop it.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:12.040
Let's get an ambulance.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.810
You're similar after all.

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.550
Similar?

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:21.850
I'll tell you something interesting.

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:26.520
Your father is Momokichi Momoi.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:30.360
You and Momomi were sisters!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.860
What are you talking about?

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:41.200
As I did all kinds of digging after Momo-baby
died, I discovered it by coincidence.

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:43.880
I don't think even the Momoi owner knew.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:49.050
I'll never believe that story.

00:19:49.050 --> 00:19:53.380
I can tell. You and Momo-baby
have the same eyes.

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:59.280
After all, that's why I was attracted
to Momo-baby.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:02.000
See you!

00:20:01.600 --> 00:20:04.730
Sakura! if you don't go to the
hospital, you'll die.

00:20:05.130 --> 00:20:06.460
Don't come near me!

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.630
I was planning to die with you anyway.

00:20:12.210 --> 00:20:15.440
You're strong after all, Mikura.
I'm no match for you.

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:17.570
I hate things like this.

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.210
I hate this too!

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:23.980
Bye-bye...

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.180
Wait!

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:32.360
Are you in with the detective too?

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:33.680
Who?

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:36.000
Get out of my way!

00:20:36.160 --> 00:20:37.720
You're the one in my way!

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:43.600
Sakura!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:21:00.680
Mikura, I probably won't be able to eat
dinner, even in the afterlife.

00:21:16.870 --> 00:21:19.860
Momo-baby, you came to pick me up.

00:21:28.850 --> 00:21:30.410
Sakura...

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:34.250
You fool!

00:21:44.060 --> 00:21:45.860
What's this?

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.690
Oh, who cares.

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.930
Mikura!

00:21:52.140 --> 00:21:54.810
What? What are you doing here?

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:55.980
Ando?

00:21:55.980 --> 00:21:58.110
You know this guy?

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:02.950
Sorry, he had a scary look on his face and
attacked me, so I kicked his ass.

00:22:03.220 --> 00:22:05.820
Attacked? You?

00:22:05.820 --> 00:22:07.810
By the way, why are you even here?

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.750
Well, I had some trouble here and there...

00:22:12.630 --> 00:22:13.830
Oh, yeah, yeah.

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:16.200
This person, maybe he attacked me

00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.690
because he mistakenly thought that
thing had been discovered?

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:33.110
Say, Mikura.

00:22:33.110 --> 00:22:34.280
What?

00:22:34.280 --> 00:22:37.050
What was that trouble you
mentioned you had earlier?

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:39.680
Oh, it was a fight, a fight.

00:22:40.050 --> 00:22:42.060
I hadn't seen my friend in a while, but...

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:45.320
Today, that friend you spent your day with...

00:22:45.630 --> 00:22:48.560
What does it matter? It's none of
your business anyway.

00:22:49.900 --> 00:22:51.920
Well, that's true, but..

00:22:54.270 --> 00:22:57.270
Oh, today wore me out.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.470
I'm hungry. Let's get something to eat.

00:22:59.470 --> 00:23:03.140
Sure, sure thing. How about
some curry noodles?

00:23:03.410 --> 00:23:05.250
Noodles again?!

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:06.540
Sorry.

